 class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">素描；速写；草图</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"166379\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たちはその<ruby>少年<rp>(</rp><rt>しょうねん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のデッサンのすばらしさに<ruby>驚嘆<rp>(</rp><rt>きょうたん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我们很惊讶这个男孩的德森的美丽。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">出直し</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">でなおし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">重新开始；从头再来；重做；再次拜访；重新登门</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">では</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"v-m\">那么；那好；所以；那就；那就再见；拜拜；在；于；用；以；如果不…；除非…</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"202137\">では<ruby>今晩<rp>(</rp><rt>こんばん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>またね、さようなら。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">今天晚上再见,再见。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">デパート</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">百货商店；百货公司；部门；科室</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"155750\">あのデパートで<ruby>新<rp>(</rp><rt>あたら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しいコートを<ruby>買<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いたい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我想在公寓里买一件新衣服。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">出迎え</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">でむかえ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">迎接；接待</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"147755\"><ruby>出迎<rp>(</rp><rt>でむか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えにきてくださってありがとう。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">谢谢你来迎接我。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">出迎える</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">でむかえる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">迎接；迎候</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"216404\">ジェーンを<ruby>出迎<rp>(</rp><rt>でむか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>える<ruby>事<rp>(</rp><rt>こと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はわくわくします。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">很高兴能见到珍。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">でも</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">接续词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">接続詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">但是；然而；虽然；不过；仍然；还是；即便如此；也；同样；即使；连；甚至；无论如何；不管怎样；即使；即便；之类的；什么的；要么……要么……；既不……也不……；伪；冒充；名义上的；聊胜于无；姑且</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"199395\">どんな<ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でもいないよりはましだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">比没有任何人更好。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">デモ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></di